    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD SERVER</h1><p></p><br><h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1709668687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1709668687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1709668687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, Farmer</h2>Shoot &amp; Sow is a top-down arena shooter roguelite, where players control unique characters and fight vegetables and fruits. Players can plant seeds to grow special items, as well as buy a variety of weapons and items to help them in their cause. Complete talent tree by defeating bosses to further upgrade your characters. Can you survive on your own farm?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farm</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/59da429b2c89391722beecb2388b4f4a.avif?t=1709668687\" /></span><br>There is one unusual feature on your farm: the plants that grow on it are very aggressive. As you move between islands on this farm, you choose what types of plants will grow on next islands. Each plant has its own unique quirks and ways to stop you. For example, carrots split in half upon deaths, eggplants sometimes charges at you, and grapes grow in groups.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/be31a25ff0e8d1bd10d3a3691890d315.avif?t=1709668687\" /></span><br>Each run consists of 4 cycles, and at the end of each cycle you will face a large plant boss. Each boss has unique attacks, which become harder and more complex with each cycle. By defeating the boss or dealing significant damage to him, you will receive upgraded item boxes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/9010dc0c558e5434e76a7226b5756433.webp?t=1709668687\" /></span><br>There are several types of weapons in the game: melee, ranged, mortars, lasers and elemental weapons. Each of them has unique properties, attack patterns and set bonuses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/a861465f5761a4acf4c49c64e6a90dab.poster.avif?t=1709668687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/a861465f5761a4acf4c49c64e6a90dab.webm?t=1709668687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>On your journey you will come across boxes with random items in them, granting you power to defeat hostile plants and polish your build.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seeds</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/188bf4d09d80c33a92a0807db7e1ffd6.avif?t=1709668687\" /></span><br>Fill planters with seeds to grow powerful items that activate under certain conditions. Grown items that are left in their boxes will evolve and change into different ones, if they are left untouched. Gather items that fit your build and let other ones grow a little longer, until they will be of use to your character.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talents</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/9f88b588fa2291cb29df51eede38395c.poster.avif?t=1709668687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/9f88b588fa2291cb29df51eede38395c.webm?t=1709668687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/9f88b588fa2291cb29df51eede38395c.mp4?t=1709668687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you progress through the game, you will earn stars, which will allow you to upgrade your characters and unlock new weapons. Gain new ways of defeating aggressive plants on your farm.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>Initial release on early access includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>16 playable characters<br></li><li>Fast runs (under 20 minutes)<br></li><li>27 weapon<br></li><li>57 items<br></li><li>29 seed items<br></li><li>16 enemy types<br></li><li>8 bosses<br></li><li>300+ talents in the tree</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, Farmer</h2>Shoot &amp; Sow is a top-down arena shooter roguelite, where players control unique characters and fight vegetables and fruits. Players can plant seeds to grow special items, as well as buy a variety of weapons and items to help them in their cause. Complete talent tree by defeating bosses to further upgrade your characters. Can you survive on your own farm?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farm</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/59da429b2c89391722beecb2388b4f4a.avif?t=1709668687\" /></span><br>There is one unusual feature on your farm: the plants that grow on it are very aggressive. As you move between islands on this farm, you choose what types of plants will grow on next islands. Each plant has its own unique quirks and ways to stop you. For example, carrots split in half upon deaths, eggplants sometimes charges at you, and grapes grow in groups.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/be31a25ff0e8d1bd10d3a3691890d315.avif?t=1709668687\" /></span><br>Each run consists of 4 cycles, and at the end of each cycle you will face a large plant boss. Each boss has unique attacks, which become harder and more complex with each cycle. By defeating the boss or dealing significant damage to him, you will receive upgraded item boxes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542080/extras/9010dc0c558e5434e76a7226b5756433.webp?t=1709668687\" /></span><br>There are several types of weapons in the game: melee, ranged, mortars, lasers and elemental weapons. Each of them has unique properties, attack patterns and set bonuses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi