y access includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>16 playable characters<br></li><li>Fast runs (under 20 minutes)<br></li><li>27 weapon<br></li><li>57 items<br></li><li>29 seed items<br></li><li>16 enemy types<br></li><li>8 bosses<br></li><li>300+ talents in the tree</li></ul>",
